@startuml
title SSD 2 — Register Arrival (UC07)
hide footbox
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
actor AdministrativeStaff as Staff
participant ":System" as System
Staff -> System: searchPatient(criteria)
alt no matching patient
  System --> Staff: [] — No patient found
else patient found
  System --> Staff: matching patients (patientID, name, dateOfBirth)
  Staff -> System: searchAppointment(patientID, date)
  alt no appointment found
    System --> Staff: [] — No appointment found
  else appointments found
    System --> Staff: appointments (appointmentID, service, professional, location,\ndateTime, status, arrivalTime)
    note left of Staff: Staff selects appointmentID.
    Staff -> System: registerArrival(appointmentID)
    alt appointment missing or actor unauthorised
      System --> Staff: notFound / accessDenied
    else appointment not confirmed
      System --> Staff: invalidState — Appointment not confirmed
    else appointment not today (clinic-local date)
      System --> Staff: wrongDate — Appointment is not today
    else arrival already registered
      System --> Staff: alreadyArrived, original arrivalTime
    else audit or commit fails
      System --> Staff: auditUnavailable / systemError
    else arrival registered
      System --> Staff: appointmentID, arrivalTime, status = confirmed
    end
  end
end
note over Staff,System
Arrival is a timestamp, not a status. No Consultation is created.
Waitlists and resources do not change this operation's contract.
end note
@enduml
